{"story_id":99510,"updated_at":"2026-11-27T03:11:03","headline_en":"Lasith Croospulle and Sineth Jayawardene score centuries to beat India A","headline_hi":"लसिथ क्रूस्पुल और सिनेथ जयवर्धने ने इंडिया ए को हराने के लिए शतक बनाए।","payload_en":{"story_id":99510,"headline":"Lasith Croospulle and Sineth Jayawardene score centuries to beat India A","counts":{"articles":3,"independent_sources":2,"outlets":2},"has_established":false,"qualified_by":"express","perspective_mode":"none","perspectives":{"–":["Aaj Tak","Times of India"]},"framing":[],"suicide":false,"thread":99510,"parents":[],"children":[],"written_at":"2026-11-27T03:11:03","category":{"v":2,"primary":["india"],"secondary":["life"],"tertiary":["sport-films"]},"places":[],"people":["Lanka","Sineth Jayawardene","Lasith Croospulle","Abhishek Sharma","Shahbaz Nadeem","Vaibhav Sooryavanshi","Asia Cup Rising Stars","Doha"],"narrative":{"paragraphs":[[{"text":"Lasith Croospulle and Sineth Jayawardene scored centuries for Sri Lanka A.","ids":[173480],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"On Thursday 26 November 2026, Tanmay Kotian dropped Sineth at backward point off his very first delivery.","ids":[173486],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"On 26 November 2026, Kotian then dropped a catch of Sineth Jayawardene in the second over.","ids":[173503],"class":"single","sources":[3]},{"text":"Indian fielders dropped catches of Sineth and Lasith early in the innings.","ids":[173508],"class":"single","sources":[3]}],[{"text":"On Thursday, 26 November 2026, India A scored 317/8 in their first innings.","ids":[173501],"class":"single","sources":[3]},{"text":"Vaibhav Sooryavanshi and Abhishek Sharma added 80 runs for the opening wicket for India.","ids":[173495],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"Sharma was caught out at long on by Lahiru Samarakoon.","ids":[173505],"class":"single","sources":[3]}],[{"text":"Tilak Varma was out while attempting a sweep shot against Ravindu Fernando.","ids":[173506],"class":"single","sources":[3]},{"text":"Lasith Croospulle and Sineth Jayawardene were the heroes of Sri Lanka's victory.","ids":[173510],"class":"single","sources":[3]}],[{"text":"A Shahbaz Nadeem scored runs in a 48-ball knock to help India reach 317 runs on Thursday, 26 November 2026, later scoring an unbeaten 54 runs for India A.","ids":[173488,173512],"parts":[{"text":"A Shahbaz Nadeem scored runs in a 48-ball knock to help India reach 317 runs on Thursday, 26 November 2026,","ids":[173488],"class":"single"},{"text":"later scoring an unbeaten 54 runs for India A.","ids":[173512],"class":"unverified"}],"class":"single","sources":[2,3]},{"text":"Nadeem scored an unbeaten 54 runs for India A, superseding the earlier figure.","ids":[173512,173488],"class":"single","sources":[2,3]},{"text":"On Thursday, 26 November 2026, India A scored 317 runs in their innings, with Nadeem scoring runs in a 48-ball knock to help India reach the total.","ids":[173478,173488],"class":"single","sources":[1,2,3]},{"text":"Sooryavanshi scored 40 runs off 26 balls.","ids":[173496],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"Sooryavanshi scored 40 runs off 26 balls, and Sharma scored 78 runs off 63 balls.","ids":[173496,173497],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"Sharma scored 78 runs off 63 balls.","ids":[173497],"class":"single","sources":[2]}],[{"text":"On Thursday, 26 November 2026, Sri Lanka A defeated India A by 8 wickets in the Asia Cup Rising Stars semi-final in Doha.","ids":[173474,173487,173500,173502],"class":"single","sources":[1,2,3]},{"text":"On Thursday, 26 November 2026, India A lost to Sri Lanka A by eight wickets in the Asia Cup Rising Stars semi-final in Doha.","ids":[173474,173500],"class":"single","sources":[1,2,3]},{"text":"Sri Lanka A chased a target of 318 runs to defeat India A, scoring 318/2 in the 42nd over to win the match.","ids":[173487,173502],"class":"single","sources":[2,3]}],[{"text":"Sri Lanka A chased the target in 40.3 overs.","ids":[173479],"class":"single","sources":[1]},{"text":"They chased the target of 318 runs in 41.3 overs.","ids":[173481],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"Harshit Rana took one wicket for 61 runs in 7 overs.","ids":[173504],"class":"single","sources":[3]},{"text":"Sineth Jayawardene scored 105 runs off 70 balls.","ids":[173490],"class":"partial","sources":[2,3]},{"text":"Lasith Croospulle scored 116 runs off 107 balls.","ids":[173491],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"He was named Player of the Match for his 105 runs against India A.","ids":[173511],"class":"single","sources":[3]}],[{"text":"Nishan Madushka scored 58 not out off 56 balls.","ids":[173492],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"Sineth Jayawardene and Lasith Croospulle shared a 174-run partnership for the first wicket.","ids":[173507],"class":"single","sources":[3]}],[{"text":"\"One odd bad day, but credit goes to Sri Lankan batsmen,\" Varma said on Thursday, adding that \"If we restrict them to anything six per over, it will be very good for us\" as the team planned to restrict Sri Lanka A to six runs per over in the first 15 overs.","ids":[173477,173482],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"On Thursday, India A scored 317 runs in their innings.","ids":[173478],"class":"unverified","sources":[1,2,3]}],[{"text":"Sri Lanka A would play in the final on Sunday against the winner of the Pakistan A and Bangladesh A semifinal.","ids":[173498],"class":"partial","sources":[2,3]}]],"section_keys":["news","happened","happened","happened","performers","performers","performers","performers","performers","say","numbers","next"],"sources":[{"n":1,"url":"https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/sports/cricket/news/one-bad-day-for-us-tilak-varma-admits-india-as-bowling-let-them-down-after-sri-lanka-as-stunning-chase/articleshow/136200806.cms","outlet":"Times of India","title":"'One bad day': Tilak Varma admits bowling let them down after SL's stunning chase","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":2,"url":"https://timesofi